  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1302.28 Land acquisition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1302.28 “Land acquisition” means the purchase of an interest in land that is needed to complete an eligible project, whether in fee or by easement. The term includes all related costs as determined by the commission to be eligible.\n\nSource. #12903, eff 10-23-19",
